bers to add news/updates (e.g., upload markdown to S3, CMS-light approach) and how front-end consumes it. \\\\n3. Specify UI approach (static site with JS framework or plain HTML), styling system, accessibility & responsiveness guidelines. \\\\n4. Explain integration points with backend (login flow, secure content fetch, contact form). \\\\n5. Note any AWS resources (S3 buckets, CloudFront distributions) that must be provisioned deterministically. \\\\nRecruit additional team members as necessary. Provide your plan via REPORT referencing this sequence ID.\\\",\\n  \\\"recipientAgentID\\\": 2,\\n  \\\"orderSequenceID\\\": \\\"frontend_plan_v1\\\"\\n}\\n###orderFrontend001###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent E (3) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_auth_supervisor_001 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Need a dedicated supervisor to design the authentication and authorization system using AWS Cognito, including user pools, identity pools, and integration with the frontend. This is a critical security component requiring specialized expertise.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Supervisor of Authentication & Identity Management\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent E (3) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_data_supervisor_002 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Require a supervisor to architect the data storage layer, including DynamoDB for document metadata, S3 for secure document storage, and proper encryption/access control policies. This supervisor will ensure data security and efficient retrieval.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Supervisor of Data Architecture & Security\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent E (3) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_api_supervisor_003 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Need a supervisor to design the API layer using Lambda and API Gateway, including all endpoints for authentication, document access, contact forms, and content management. This supervisor will ensure proper API design and integration.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Supervisor of API Development & Integration\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent E (3) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_infra_supervisor_004 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Require a supervisor to handle infrastructure concerns including CloudFront CDN setup, Route 53 DNS configuration, deployment pipelines, monitoring, and cost optimization strategies.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Supervisor of Infrastructure & DevOps\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent Vanto (6) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_storage_001 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Need an Attendant to design the S3 bucket architecture, including structure, naming conventions, lifecycle policies, and integration with the broader system for secure document storage.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Storage Architecture Lead\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent Vanto (6) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_database_001 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Need an Attendant to design DynamoDB schemas for metadata, user profiles, and content management, ensuring optimal query patterns and data modeling.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Database Design Lead\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent S (5) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_001 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I need a specialized Attendant to focus on authentication and authorization patterns, including Cognito integration, JWT handling, and security middleware. This is a critical component that requires dedicated expertise.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Authentication & Authorization Architect\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\