s off, could you please describe the first project or objective you would like us to accomplish?\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"I am very interested in building a website for my neighborhood HOA. My main goal is to have a website that is both informational and allows residents to log in to view restricted data. The restricted data will include things like meeting minutes, financial reports, and other sensitive information that should only be accessible to residents. Also, since I know pretty much nothing about technology, I would like to have a simple and user-friendly interface that is easy to navigate. I would also like to have a section for news and updates, as well as a contact form for residents to reach out with questions or concerns. Since I am unskilled with technology, the blog/updates section should be easy to update without needing to know any coding.\\\\\\\"\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n  ]\\\\n}\\\"\\n}\\n###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-22T01:45:04.507Z###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###rec_backend###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: RECRUIT\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"We need a high-level expert to design and plan all cloud infrastructure, authentication, data storage, and security for the HOA website within AWS.\\\",\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Director of Backend Engineering\\\"\\n}\\n###rec_backend###\\n\\n###rec_frontend###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: RECRUIT\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"We need a senior leader to plan the website’s user interface, content-update workflow for non-technical users, overall UX, and accessibility.\\\",\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Director of Frontend & User Experience\\\"\\n}\\n###rec_frontend###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-22T01:45:17.660Z###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Operations Department, System Call Directorate\\nTo: 1\\nType: Call Results\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"result\\\": \\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"results\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"callID\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"rec_backend\\\\\\\",\\\\n