{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent Vanto (6) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_security_001 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Need an Attendant to architect the security layer including KMS encryption, IAM policies, compliance requirements, and overall security best practices.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Security Architecture Lead\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent S (5) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_002 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I need an Attendant to design the document management API endpoints, including access control, file operations, and DynamoDB integration. This requires specific expertise in handling sensitive document storage and retrieval.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Document Management API Lead\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent S (5) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_003 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I need an Attendant to handle the contact form API and email integration with SES, including template management, validation, and anti-spam measures. This requires expertise in email services and form handling.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Communications API Specialist\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Acknowledged. All requested recruitments have been approved, and I am now awaiting the comprehensive plans and subsequent reports from our Backend and Frontend Directors and their newly formed teams.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent S (5) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_001 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I need a specialized Attendant to focus on authentication and authorization patterns, including Cognito integration, JWT handling, and security middleware. This is a critical component that requires dedicated expertise.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Authentication & Authorization Architect\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent S (5) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_002 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I need an Attendant to design the document management API endpoints, including access control, file operations, and DynamoDB integration. This requires specific expertise in handling sensitive document storage and retrieval.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Document Management API Lead\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent S (5) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_004 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I need an Attendant to design the content management API that allows non-technical users to update the blog/news section. This requires creating an intuitive API that interfaces with S3 and processes content updates.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Content Management API Engineer\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent S (5) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_005 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I need an Attendant to establish monitoring, logging, and error handling patterns across all API endpoints, including CloudWatch integration, custom metrics, and alerting strategies.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"API Observability & Reliability Engineer\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent S (5) is requesting approval for call ID recruit_003 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I need an Attendant to design the contact form API with SES integration, including email templates, validation, anti-spam measures, and form submission handling. This is a critical component that wasn't covered in my initial recruitment.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Contact Form & Email Services Engineer\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-22T01:57:43.410Z###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Operations Department, System Call Directorate\\nTo: 1\\nType: Call Results\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"result\\\": \\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"results\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"callID\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"orderBackend001\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"SUCCESS\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"details\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Report for order backend_plan_v1 from agent 3: Director of Backend Engineering - Comprehensive Technical Plan for HOA Website Backend & Cloud Infrastructure\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nI have successfully developed a complete backend architecture plan leveraging AWS services to meet all HOA website requirements. The solution provides secure resident authentication, document storage with role-based access, public content delivery, email functionality, and an intuitive content management system for non-technical users.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 1. ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Core Services Selection:\\\\\\\\n- **Static Hosting**: S3 + CloudFront CDN for public website\\\\\\\\n- **Authentication**: AWS Cognito (User Pool + Identity Pool)\\\\\\\\n- **Document Storage**: S3 with encryption + DynamoDB for metadata\\\\\\\\n- **API Layer**: API Gateway + Lambda functions\\\\\\\\n- **Email Service**: SES for contact forms and notifications\\\\\\\\n- **Monitoring**: CloudWatch, X-Ray, and CloudTrail\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 2. AUTHENTICATION & AUTHORIZATION (COGNITO)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### User Pool Configuration:\\\\\\\\n- **Name**: HOA_UserPool\\\\\\\\n- **Sign-in**: Email (primary), Phone (optional)\\\\\\\\n- **Password Policy**: 12+ chars, uppercase, lowercase, numbers, symbols\\\\\\\\n- **MFA**: Optional for residents, mandatory for board/admins\\\\\\\\n- **User Groups**: residents, board-members, admins\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Identity Pool:\\\\\\\\n- **Name**: HOA_IdentityPool\\\\\\\\n- **Role Mapping**: Token-based by group\\\\\\\\n  - Cognito_HOAResidentsAuth_Role\\\\\\\\n  - Cognito_HOABoardAuth_Role\\\\\\\\n  - Cognito_HOAAdminsAuth_Role\\\\\\\\n  - Cognito_HOAUnauth_Role (public access)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Lambda Triggers:\\\\\\\\n- PreSignUp: Validate resident roster\\\\\\\\n- PostConfirmation: Assign groups, welcome email\\\\\\\\n- PreTokenGeneration: Inject custom claims\\\\\\\\n- CustomMessage: Branded email templates\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 3. DATA STORAGE ARCHITECTURE\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### S3 Bucket Structure:\\\\\\\\n```\\\\\\\\nhoa-documents-prod/\\\\\\\\n├── meeting-minutes/<YEAR>/\\\\\\\\n├── financial-reports/<YEAR>/\\\\\\\\n├── newsletters/<YEAR>/\\\\\\\\n└── resident-documents/<RESIDENT-ID>/\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nhoa-public-assets-prod/\\\\\\\\n└── (CloudFront origin for static assets)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nhoa-logs-prod/\\\\\\\\n└── (Centralized logging)\\\\\\\\n```\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### DynamoDB Tables:\\\\\\\\n1. **DocumentMetadata**\\\\\\\\n   - PK: documentId, SK: version\\\\\\\\n   - GSIs: ByCategory, ByUploader, ByAccessLevel\\\\\\\\n   \\\\\\\\n2. **UserProfiles**\\\\\\\\n   - PK: userId\\\\\\\\n   - GSIs: ByEmail, ByRole\\\\\\\\n   \\\\\\\\n3. **ContentManagement**\\\\\\\\n   - PK: postId, SK: publishDate\\\\\\\\n   - GSIs: ByCategory, AllByDate\\\\\\\\n   \\\\\\\\n4. **AuditLog**\\\\\\\\n   - PK: auditId, SK: eventTime\\\\\\\\n   - TTL: 365 days\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Security:\\\\\\\\n- KMS encryption at rest (separate keys for S3, DynamoDB)\\\\\\\\n- TLS 1.3 minimum for all connections\\\\\\\\n- IAM policies enforce least privilege\\\\\\\\n- S3 bucket policies deny unencrypted uploads\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 4. API LAYER DESIGN\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### API Gateway Structure:\\\\\\\\n```\\\\\\\\nhttps://api.hoa-website.org/\\\\\\\\n├── /auth (login, logout, refresh, register)\\\\\\\\n├── /documents (CRUD operations)\\\\\\\\n├── /posts (blog/news management)\\\\\\\\n├── /contact (form submission)\\\\\\\\n└── /health (monitoring)\\\\\\\\n```\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Lambda Functions:\\\\\\\\n- **AuthServiceFn**: Handle authentication flows\\\\\\\\n- **DocumentServiceFn**: Document management (512MB)\\\\\\\\n- **CmsHandlerFn**: Blog/news CRUD operations\\\\\\\\n- **ContactValidateFn**: Process contact forms\\\\\\\\n- **SesEventsFn**: Handle email events\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Content Management for Non-Technical Users:\\\\\\\\n- Simple file upload to designated S3 bucket\\\\\\\\n- Lambda automatically processes and publishes\\\\\\\\n- No coding required for updates\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 5. EMAIL SERVICE (SES)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- Verified domain for HOA\\\\\\\\n- Templates: Contact confirmation, notifications\\\\\\\\n- SQS queue for reliable processing\\\\\\\\n- Bounce/complaint handling\\\\\\\\n- Anti-spam measures with rate limiting\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 6. INFRASTRUCTURE & DEPLOYMENT\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### CloudFront CDN:\\\\\\\\n- OAC to S3 origins\\\\\\\\n- Cache behaviors optimized by content type\\\\\\\\n- Security headers via Lambda@Edge\\\\\\\\n- SSL/TLS via ACM certificate\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### CI/CD Pipeline:\\\\\\\\n- CodePipeline: Source → Build → Deploy\\\\\\\\n- Staging environment for testing\\\\\\\\n- Manual approval for production\\\\\\\\n- Automated CloudFront invalidation\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Monitoring:\\\\\\\\n- CloudWatch alarms for errors, latency\\\\\\\\n- X-Ray tracing for API calls\\\\\\\\n- Custom dashboards for key metrics\\\\\\\\n- SNS notifications for critical alerts\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 7. SCALABILITY & COST\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Performance:\\\\\\\\n- Lambda auto-scaling\\\\\\\\n- DynamoDB on-demand billing\\\\\\\\n- CloudFront global edge locations\\\\\\\\n- API Gateway rate limiting\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Estimated Monthly Costs:\\\\\\\\n- Compute (Lambda): ~$30\\\\\\\\n- Storage (S3/DynamoDB): ~$50\\\\\\\\n- API Gateway: ~$50\\\\\\\\n- CloudFront: ~$20\\\\\\\\n- Monitoring: ~$15\\\\\\\\n- **Total: ~$165/month**\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 8. SECURITY & COMPLIANCE\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- All data encrypted at rest and in transit\\\\\\\\n- M